- VISIP main script:  
    How to have maximally selfcontained VISIP in Docker image:
    PBS -> Remote Container Manager -> container -> VISIP main (read config) -> use SSH luncher to start on other machines 
           RCM wrapper sripts: smpirun, svisip; inner script works with general internal manager
        -> VISIP -> SSH or other connection 
        -> manager ->  SSH start runners on allocated nodes
               ->  MPI on allocated nodes
               ->  other PBS job                               

   PBS -> RCM -> VISIP main script (takes -luncher argument)            
               
               
