Representation improvement (Ideas)
- separate completely code processing and code representation
  from the "model" - data clases representing the code
  model classes can provide a virtual methods to have a common interface, but only calling external
  representation functions. Creation from code should use same setters as GUI.

- model should be able to modify its structure and make basic validation

- make full (recursive) validation of the analysis
- then the dynamic expansion to the DAG of tasks follows

- action call components:
  code_representation details (variable name of the instance, action, its name and module, comments, ...)
  call_details (function, inputs binding, signature ... runtime checks)
